sentences.l:
For I too once a house among men inhabited,
prosperous, a rich one, and often I used to give to a vagrant,
to one such as he might be and of whatever in need he might come;

There truly I on my part ordered my trusty companions
right there by the ships to stay and the ships to guard,
and scouts to the lookouts I urged to go;

and in among them bolt-delighting Zeus
an evil panic into my companions cast, and not one brought himself
to stand opposed;

Truly not any anguish is there in the mind, nor any grief,
when a man, over his own possessions fighting,
is struck, either over cattle or over white sheep;

But Telemachus, in his heart, great grief made grow
for the man struck, and no tear to the ground cast from his eyelids,
but in silence he shook his head, evils devising deep within.
